<section class="features">

  <div class="feature-row">
    <div class="feature-row__text">
      <p class="feature-row__num">01 &mdash; 符合规范优先</p>
      <h2 class="feature-row__title">默认符合规范。<br>严格程度随心调整。</h2>
      <p class="feature-row__body">
        Basilisk 开箱即按 Python 类型规范检查——与官方符合性套件评分所用的规则相同。
        更严格的检查来自 Basilisk 自身，且完全可选：要求每个参数和返回值都有注解、
        标记冗余注解、提示 <code>@override</code>。规范将未注解的代码视为<em>推断</em>类型而非错误，
        因此这些检查默认关闭——当你需要超出规范的检查时，再通过配置按文件或路径开启。
        一键"补全"修复还能自动为您添加缺失的类型。
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-row__visual">
      <div class="stat-block">
        <span class="stat-block__number">{{ ruleStats.total }}</span>
        <span class="stat-block__label">条规则，皆可配置</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="feature-row">
    <div class="feature-row__visual">
      <div class="stat-block">
        <span class="stat-block__number">10<span class="stat-block__unit">/10</span></span>
        <span class="stat-block__label">基准测试的规则胜过 Pyright</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-row__text">
      <p class="feature-row__num">02 &mdash; 实测，而非承诺</p>
      <h2 class="feature-row__title">快过 Pyright。<br>我们基准测试的每条规则。</h2>
      <p class="feature-row__body">
        每次发布都运行 <code>make bench</code>——用 hyperfine 在相同的固定用例上对 Pyright、
        mypy、ty 和 Pyrefly 测量挂钟时间，数据提交到代码库。在我们基准测试的规则上，
        Basilisk 的冷启动全文件检查全面胜过 Pyright。而且由于重检是增量的——只重新分析
        被编辑的文件及其导入方——热编辑做的工作更少。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="feature-row">
    <div class="feature-row__text">
      <p class="feature-row__num">03 &mdash; 快速修复与重构</p>
      <h2 class="feature-row__title">灯泡随时可用。<br>每条诊断皆如此。</h2>
      <p class="feature-row__body">
        许多诊断都附带一键修复——添加缺失的注解、
        将 <code>Optional[X]</code> 现代化为 <code>X | None</code>、转换为 f-string。
        此外还有完整的重构套件：提取、内联、更改签名和移动符号。
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-row__visual">
      <div class="code-window" style="width:100%;max-width:400px">
        <div class="code-window__chrome">
          <span class="code-window__dot code-window__dot--close"></span>
          <span class="code-window__dot code-window__dot--min"></span>
          <span class="code-window__dot code-window__dot--expand"></span>
          <span class="code-window__filename">quick-fix.py</span>
        </div>
        <div class="code-window__body">
<pre><span class="tok-cmt"># 💡 快速修复可用</span>
<span class="tok-kw">def</span> <span class="tok-fn">process</span>(data) <span class="tok-cmt"># BSK-E0001</span>

<span class="tok-cmt"># → 添加类型注解</span>
<span class="tok-kw">def</span> <span class="tok-fn">process</span>(data<span class="tok-type">: str</span>) <span class="tok-kw">-></span> <span class="tok-type">str</span>:
  <span class="tok-kw">return</span> data.upper()</pre>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="feature-row">
    <div class="feature-row__visual">
      <div class="stat-block">
        <span class="stat-block__number">{{ conformance.scorePct }}<span class="stat-block__unit">%</span></span>
        <span class="stat-block__label">PEP 符合性得分</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-row__text">
      <p class="feature-row__num">04 &mdash; PEP 符合性</p>
      <h2 class="feature-row__title">{{ conformance.total }} 个测试中 {{ conformance.pass }} 个通过（{{ conformance.scorePct }}%）。<br>每条符合性规则均已启用。</h2>
      <p class="feature-row__body">
        由<a href="https://github.com/python/typing/blob/main/conformance/results/results.html">官方 Python 类型符合性套件</a>评分——
        同一套公开的评分工具也为 Pyright、mypy 和 Pyrefly 打分，它们的当前得分见该结果表。
        我们在真实二进制文件上运行它，启用每一条符合性规则、不禁用任何规则：{{ conformance.categoriesTotal }} 个类别中有 {{ conformance.categoriesPass100 }} 个达到 100%，误报 {{ conformance.fp }} 处、遗漏的必需错误 {{ conformance.missed }} 处。Basilisk 的可选规则在符合性评分中从不运行，因此无法虚增得分。<a href="/zh/docs/conformance/">我们如何衡量 &rarr;</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="feature-row">
    <div class="feature-row__visual">
      <div class="code-window" style="width:100%;max-width:400px">
        <div class="code-window__chrome">
          <span class="code-window__dot code-window__dot--close"></span>
          <span class="code-window__dot code-window__dot--min"></span>
          <span class="code-window__dot code-window__dot--expand"></span>
          <span class="code-window__filename">Basilisk 输出</span>
        </div>
        <div class="code-window__body">
<pre><span class="tok-cmt">[Basilisk Debug]</span> createDebugAdapterDescriptor
  type=<span class="tok-type">basilisk-debug</span>, request=<span class="tok-str">launch</span>

<span class="tok-cmt">[Basilisk Debug]</span> 请求 LSP 启动
  debugpy (python: <span class="tok-fn">auto-detect</span>)...

<span class="tok-cmt">[Basilisk Debug]</span> LSP 启动了 debugpy &rarr;
  正在连接 DAP 客户端到
  <span class="tok-type">localhost</span>:<span class="tok-num">57356</span></pre>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-row__text">
      <p class="feature-row__num">05 &mdash; 集成调试</p>
      <h2 class="feature-row__title">按 F5 开始调试。<br>Basilisk 处理其余的。</h2>
      <p class="feature-row__body">
        设置断点、逐步执行代码、检查变量——全部通过 Basilisk LSP 代理。
        Rust 服务器在空闲 TCP 端口上启动 debugpy 并自动连接 VS Code 的 DAP 客户端。
        无需手动配置。无需单独的调试扩展。只需按 F5。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="feature-row">
    <div class="feature-row__text">
      <p class="feature-row__num">06 &mdash; 单一二进制文件</p>
      <h2 class="feature-row__title">放入 PATH。<br>这就是全部安装。</h2>
      <p class="feature-row__body">
        编译为独立的 Rust 二进制文件。无需 Node.js。无需 Python 解释器。
        无需 <code>pip install</code>。无需 <code>npm install</code>。
        从单次下载即可在 macOS、Linux 和 Windows 上运行。
      </p>
    </div>
